|GK0Necros study death, undeath, runes, and supernatural power. They are
physically fragile spellcasters who can deal heavy damage, raise followers,
and shape a fight through magic rather than ordinary armour and weapons.|000

|GK0Their power flows through two runes. Those runes support a broad spell
catalog and the undead followers that fight beside them. Necro is best suited
to a player who enjoys managing spells, minions, and a dangerous caster
toolkit.|000

